  "courseSlug": "remix-course",
  "courseTitle": "Remix.js - The Practical Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "34674444",
      "title": "Adding Links & Building a SPA (Single-Page Application)",
      "lectureOrder": 14,
      "videoOrder": 10,
      "sourceHash": "197b79442c109638eca8fab6133e996cd41bb2c8d7ed4ef393a7bd9b3b516e5f",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 4.05,
          "en": "Now when it comes to routing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.05,
          "end": 7.02,
          "en": "and defining routes, Remix has way more",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.02,
          "end": 9.09,
          "en": "to offer than what we saw here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.09,
          "end": 12.724,
          "en": "It's not just about adding files that represent the paths",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.724,
          "end": 15.15,
          "en": "which we can add after our domain,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.15,
          "end": 17.52,
          "en": "but this is one of the most important features.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.52,
          "end": 18.9,
          "en": "But we're, of course, going to dive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.9,
          "end": 21.9,
          "en": "into all the other features Remix has to offer related",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.9,
          "end": 23.58,
          "en": "to routing later in this course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.58,
          "end": 25.833,
          "en": "once we dive deeper into Remix, though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26.76,
          "end": 30.378,
          "en": "Now, for a start here, what I wanna do is I wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.378,
          "end": 32.453,
          "en": "that we can switch between these routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.453,
          "end": 36.51,
          "en": "not just by manually entering different URL's here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.51,
          "end": 39.63,
          "en": "in the URL address bar of the browser,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.63,
          "end": 42.66,
          "en": "but by instead offering a link, which I can click.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.66,
          "end": 45.36,
          "en": "And I'll start on this starting page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.36,
          "end": 47.64,
          "en": "Here, we could wrap this h1 element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.64,
          "end": 51.27,
          "en": "into a fragment with this special fragment component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.27,
          "end": 54.54,
          "en": "which is a default React component offered by React;",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.54,
          "end": 56.283,
          "en": "has nothing to do with Remix.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.12,
          "end": 59.46,
          "en": "And then below that, we could add a link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.46,
          "end": 62.88,
          "en": "by adding an anchor element here and say",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 62.88,
          "end": 65.82,
          "en": "go to Demo Page as a caption,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 65.82,
          "end": 69.72,
          "en": "and then add the ref attribute, which points at /demo.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.72,
          "end": 71.27,
          "en": "That's how we could add a link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.2,
          "end": 75.87,
          "en": "Now if we do that, we can save that, of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 75.87,
          "end": 79.5,
          "en": "go back to the starting page, and we see the link here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 79.5,
          "end": 81.93,
          "en": "If I click the link, it also works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 81.93,
          "end": 84.03,
          "en": "I go to this Demo Page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 84.03,
          "end": 86.46000000000001,
          "en": "But there is a small gotcha here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 86.46000000000001,
          "end": 89.88,
          "en": "If you watch this refresh icon here, you'll see that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.88,
          "end": 94.41,
          "en": "as I click this link, watch this icon, it briefly changes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 94.41,
          "end": 99.09,
          "en": "to a cross, which indicates that a new request was sent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 99.09,
          "end": 101.973,
          "en": "and that we actually downloaded a new file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 103.35,
          "end": 105.15,
          "en": "We can also confirm this behavior",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 105.15,
          "end": 107.52000000000001,
          "en": "by open the developer tools,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 107.52000000000001,
          "end": 110.13300000000001,
          "en": "and there going to the network tab.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 112.41,
          "end": 115.74000000000001,
          "en": "Here, if I click on go to Demo Page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 115.74000000000001,
          "end": 118.08,
          "en": "we see that a bunch of requests were sent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 118.08,
          "end": 122.13,
          "en": "Most importantly, one request for the demo page HTML file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 122.13,
          "end": 125.1,
          "en": "which was received as a response.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 125.1,
          "end": 128.01,
          "en": "Now this has a couple of important implications.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 128.01,
          "end": 130.35,
          "en": "If we take a look at this response, we see that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 130.35,
          "end": 133.2,
          "en": "it indeed is a brand new HTML file that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 133.2,
          "end": 135.63,
          "en": "contains the content of this Demo Page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 135.63,
          "end": 139.02,
          "en": "That's great for a search engine optimization, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 139.02,
          "end": 141.66,
          "en": "because it means that we really downloaded a new",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 141.66,
          "end": 143.673,
          "en": "finished HTML file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 144.84,
          "end": 147.06,
          "en": "But the disadvantage of this is that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 147.06,
          "end": 149.67000000000002,
          "en": "we did send a new request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 149.67000000000002,
          "end": 152.64,
          "en": "Now, it would be nice if we're already on this page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 152.64,
          "end": 154.92000000000002,
          "en": "if we could just navigate to a different page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 154.92000000000002,
          "end": 157.8,
          "en": "with client side JavaScript only.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 157.8,
          "end": 160.86,
          "en": "So if we enter our URL manually, it would be nice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 160.86,
          "end": 163.56,
          "en": "if we download the finished HTML code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 163.56,
          "end": 166.2,
          "en": "But if we are on the website already, just",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 166.2,
          "end": 168.93,
          "en": "on a different page, and we then click a link,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 168.93,
          "end": 171.81,
          "en": "it would be great if the next page would be loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 171.81,
          "end": 174.42000000000002,
          "en": "by using the client side JavaScript code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 174.42000000000002,
          "end": 176.31,
          "en": "fetching any data that might be needed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 176.31,
          "end": 178.71,
          "en": "maybe behind the scenes, and otherwise",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 178.71,
          "end": 180.84,
          "en": "not sending a new request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 180.84,
          "end": 183.24,
          "en": "Because that saves us from downloading",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 183.24,
          "end": 186.96,
          "en": "all the JavaScript code that makes up our application again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 186.96,
          "end": 189.69,
          "en": "Because with Remix, you of course still have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 189.69,
          "end": 191.76,
          "en": "client side JavaScript code, even",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 191.76,
          "end": 196.02,
          "en": "though you are pre-rendering pages on the server on the fly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 196.02,
          "end": 198.9,
          "en": "But you still build a React application where you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 198.9,
          "end": 202.14,
          "en": "of course, also still have client side JavaScript code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 202.14,
          "end": 204.75,
          "en": "for example, to handle user input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 204.75,
          "end": 208.86,
          "en": "or react to button clicks or do whatever you wanna do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 208.86,
          "end": 211.8,
          "en": "And to make sure that we're not leaving this page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 211.8,
          "end": 213.54,
          "en": "and we're re-fetching everything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 213.54,
          "end": 216,
          "en": "when we click a link, we should not use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 216,
          "end": 218.46,
          "en": "this default anchor element, but instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 218.46,
          "end": 222.18,
          "en": "a special component offered by Remix.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 222.18,
          "end": 227.18,
          "en": "And that component is imported from @remix/react",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 228.51,
          "end": 230.883,
          "en": "and it's the link component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 232.68,
          "end": 234.9,
          "en": "Now, this link component is a component you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 234.9,
          "end": 238.11,
          "en": "of course might know from React Router, which by the way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 238.11,
          "end": 242.16,
          "en": "is a package developed by the same team that built Remix.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 242.16,
          "end": 244.56,
          "en": "But here we're not importing it from React Router",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 244.56,
          "end": 247.653,
          "en": "but instead from @remix-run/react.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 248.79,
          "end": 253.14,
          "en": "Now, if we use this link instead of the anchor element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 253.14,
          "end": 257.61,
          "en": "and we replace the ref attribute with the to prompt,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 257.61,
          "end": 261.39,
          "en": "then you'll see that if I save everything and I go back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 261.39,
          "end": 264.72,
          "en": "to the starting page, I still have the link here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 264.72,
          "end": 268.11,
          "en": "But if you watch this refresh icon again, as I click it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 268.11,
          "end": 270.39300000000003,
          "en": "it does not turn to a cross.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 271.56,
          "end": 273.87,
          "en": "And if I open the developer tools, you will see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 273.87,
          "end": 277.02,
          "en": "that if I click this link, there is just one request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 277.02,
          "end": 280.86,
          "en": "for the fav icon hear, but no other requests being sent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 280.86,
          "end": 283.17,
          "en": "So now we don't re-download everything,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 283.17,
          "end": 286.77,
          "en": "but we instead stay on the page on which we already were.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 286.77,
          "end": 288.75,
          "en": "So we get the best of both worlds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 288.75,
          "end": 291.87,
          "en": "New visitors that enter a URL or",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 291.87,
          "end": 293.85,
          "en": "click a link on some other website,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 293.85,
          "end": 298.26,
          "en": "download the finished HTML files as they reach our website,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 298.26,
          "end": 302.37,
          "en": "but users that are already on the website stay on that site",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 302.37,
          "end": 305.04,
          "en": "and basically get a single page application again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 305.04,
          "end": 308.13,
          "en": "after sending this first request when they first",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 308.13,
          "end": 309.543,
          "en": "visited the website.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
